  "description": "The SCOTT Spark DC 20 is built for riders who want more from every ride. Grounded in our world-class racing pedigree, it brings together cross-country speed and downhill attitude in a single, capable package—engineered for deep mountain missions without compromise.\n\nEvery detail is considered to deliver efficiency, stability, and playfulness in equal measure. A low center of mass keeps the ride balanced and controlled through flow trails and jump lines, working through the 140mm front and 138mm rear travel with confidence. The lightweight next-generation HMF carbon frame floats on the climbs and accelerates decisively out of corners and onto open singletrack—a balance of performance and capability refined throughout the Spark legacy.\n\nKeeping your wheels planted—unless that's not your goal—are the ultralight Fox 36SL fork and Float Factory shock, both with a custom tune built for a plush, responsive feel that makes every trail genuinely enjoyable. From short rides and feature sessions to full weekend epics, the suspension is engineered to elevate trail riding across whatever you have planned.\n\nThe component spec makes it a high-value package without compromise. Shimano XT Di2 wireless drivetrain and Syncros Silverton AL2 alloy wheels deliver reliable, precise performance across every condition. Integrated frame storage keeps your Save The Day kit and essentials close, and generous bikepacking compatibility means the bike is just as ready for multi-day escapes as it is for your local riding.\n\nPerformance also extends to practicality. Improved serviceability and tunability make it straightforward to customize your setup and keep the bike riding exactly how you like it—so you spend less time in the workshop and more time on the trail.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
